Title: One Slot, Two Mics

.INT. AFTERGLOW - BACKSTAGE - NIGHT

Extreme close-up on a brass ticket. One slot is stamped across the face.

@MARA
One slot. Which one of us did you cut?

.INT. AFTERGLOW - CURTAIN - CONTINUOUS

Stay behind the red curtain. A single amber microphone glows through the opening.

@JACOBIE
Listen to the count. It starts before I play.

.INT. AFTERGLOW - SOUND DESK - CONTINUOUS

Cut to two meters. Mara taps twice. Both meters answer.

@MARA
That second track. That's my rehearsal.

.INT. AFTERGLOW - STAGE - CONTINUOUS

Pull the curtains apart. A second microphone catches the light. The marquee changes from SOLO to DUET.

@JACOBIE
You gave me your slot. I gave us a band.

.INT. AFTERGLOW - STAGE - MOMENTS LATER

Hold on the two live channels. Drop the music and leave one beat of silence before the final count.

@MARA
Then follow my tempo. One. Two.
